msgid "This Windows sits inside the folder \"Old PC\\\", so it cannot start. It was probably copied or moved there."
msgstr "此 Windows 位于文件夹 \"Old PC\\\" 中，因此无法启动。它可能是被复制或移动到那里的。"

msgid "After the move, copies fresh start-up files and writes a start-up entry for this Windows."
msgstr "移动后，会复制新的启动文件，并为此 Windows 写入启动条目。"

