msgstr "\n\n注意：这台电脑上有一个驱动器被 BitLocker 锁定。删除任何内容之前，请先解锁它并重新扫描。"

msgid "\n\nFor a technician: "
msgstr "\n\n供技术人员参考： "

msgid "The start-up entry \""
msgstr "启动条目 \""

msgid "\" expects Windows in "
msgstr "\" 期望 Windows 位于 "

msgid " on this drive, but it is now in "
msgstr " （此驱动器上），但它现在位于 "

